{"story_id":99187,"updated_at":"2026-11-26T20:51:59","headline_en":"Opening batter Mohammed Azharuddeen displays Samson tribute after hitting second T20 century","headline_hi":"ओपनिंग बल्लेबाज मोहम्मद अज़हरुद्दीन ने टी20 में दूसरा शतक लगाने के बाद सैमसन को श्रद्धांजलि दी","payload_en":{"story_id":99187,"headline":"Opening batter Mohammed Azharuddeen displays Samson tribute after hitting second T20 century","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["The Hindu","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":99187,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-26T20:51:59","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":["kerala"],"people":["Mohammed Azharuddeen","Openers Azharuddeen","Sanju Samson","Abdul Basith","Syed Mushtaq","Rohan Kunnummal","Salman Nizar","Arpit Guleria"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"On 26 November, Mohammed Azharuddeen reached his century in 56 balls.","ids":[172325],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Friday, Azharuddeen scored his second T20 hundred of 101 runs off 57 balls against Himachal Pradesh in the Syed Mushtaq Ali Trophy.","ids":[172338],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Azharuddeen scored a century in a Syed Mushtaq Ali Trophy match against Himachal Pradesh., Mushtaq batter On Thursday.","ids":[172319],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"He reached his hundred off 56 balls.","ids":[172344],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Azharuddeen hit Arpit Guleria for a six.","ids":[172345],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"On Friday, Kerala registered a 67-run win over Himachal Pradesh to qualify for the Super League in the Syed Mushtaq Ali Trophy.","ids":[172339],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"It posted 268 for four against Himachal Pradesh.","ids":[172340],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"It finished at 201 for five.","ids":[172341],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Abdul Basith provided a late boost for Kerala.","ids":[172323],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Thursday, Azharuddeen showed the name 'Sanju Samson' written on his bat to the camera.","ids":[172320],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Samson decided to bat first.","ids":[172342],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"The wicketkeeper-batter shared an 82-run opening partnership with Rohan Kunnummal.","ids":[172322],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Mridul Surroch picked up two wickets for Himachal Pradesh.","ids":[172324],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"M.D. Nidheesh and K.M. Asif removed the Himachal Pradesh openers.","ids":[172346],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Vaibhav Kalta and Aryaman Singh's performance was insufficient for Himachal Pradesh.","ids":[172360],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"The camera captured Samson's reaction to the gesture while he was sitting in the dressing room.","ids":[172337],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Kunnummal scored 35 runs off 16 balls.","ids":[172330],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Samson scored 44 off 21 balls.","ids":[172327],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Vishnu Vinod scored 22 runs off 11 balls.","ids":[172331],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Basith scored 24 runs off five balls and remained unbeaten.","ids":[172333],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Samson scored 44 runs from 21 balls.","ids":[172351],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Kerala posted a total of 268/4 in 20 overs, finishing with 268 for four wickets at a run rate of 13.40.","ids":[172326,172335],"parts":[{"text":"Kerala posted a total of 268/4 in 20 overs,","ids":[172326],"class":"single"},{"text":"finishing with 268 for four wickets at a run rate of 13.40.","ids":[172335],"class":"partial"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Kerala's total of 268 for four was the highest total at the PCA New International stadium.","ids":[172348],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Basith scored 24 not out for Kerala.","ids":[172365],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"The batter's innings included eight fours and six sixes, and the wicketkeeper-batter struck at a strike rate of 177.19.","ids":[172328,172329],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Salman Nizar scored 26 runs off 15 balls and remained unbeaten.","ids":[172332],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Nizar scored 26 not out.","ids":[172364],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Basith scored at a strike rate of 480.","ids":[172334],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"It each took one wicket for Himachal Pradesh.","ids":[172336],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"It reduced Himachal Pradesh to 97 for five.","ids":[172359],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Azharuddeen and Kunnummal added 82 runs inside the PowerPlay, they then added 77 runs for the second wicket with Samson.","ids":[172349,172352],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","say","numbers","numbers","numbers","numbers","numbers","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/news/mohammed-azharuddeen-flashes-samson-on-bat-after-century-sanju-samsons-reaction-caught-on-camera/articleshow/136183585.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"Batter flashes 'Samson' on bat after century; Sanju Samson's reaction goes viral","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/syed-mushtaq-ali-trophy-azharuddeens-century-powers-kerala-into-the-super-league/article71747210.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"Syed Mushtaq Ali Trophy: Azharuddeen’s century powers Kerala into the Super League","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true}],"other_coverage":[{"text":"Andhra recorded a seven-wicket win over Maharashtra","ids":[172343],"class":"singl